        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. A teacher shall have easy access to all locally used state adopted textbooks in each of the courses he teaches. A teacher shall be provided with a copy of the textbook, teacher guide and activity manual used in each of the courses he teaches.",
            "block_bbox": [
                63,
