        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. A teacher shall not be required or expected to provide personal property for school use, including textbooks, audiovisual equipment, or other instructional materials and supplies. The Board shall not be responsible for loss of any personal property volunteered by a teacher for school use.",
